  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Complete small long-snouted mammaliaform with slender balancing tail; adult M.oehleri skull informs a genus-level inferred living body.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Genus-level whole living reconstruction, not an articulated fossil or scan. Cranial shape uses adult M.oehleri IVPP8685; body uses Museum Wales research-informed reconstruction. Body and tail proportions, fur, external ears and colors are inferred; do not combine them into a measured single individual. Skull model length32mm is an approximate reading of the DigiMorph5mm image bar, not a published caliper measurement.\",\"zh\":\"属级完整活体复原，非完整关节连接化石或扫描。颅形参考成年M.oehleri IVPP8685；身体参考威尔士博物馆研究复原。身体尾部比例、毛、外耳与色彩均为推断，不得宣称同一标本实测。颅长32毫米为DigiMorph图5毫米尺估读，非论文卡尺实测。\"},\"original_inventory_ordinal\":664,\"taxon\":\"Morganucodon, genus-level reconstruction\",\"classification\":\"Morganucodontidae, Mammaliaformes; stem mammal, not a modern rodent\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"skull_length_model_m\":0.032,\"head_body_model_m\":0.11,\"tail_model_m\":0.06,\"status\":\"Skull approximate image-ruler estimate: about6.4 times labeled5mm. Head-body110mm and tail60mm artistic proportions using museum reconstruction, not complete fossil measurements.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Slender elongated low snout, visible transition to somewhat wider posterior skull, not globular short mouse face.\",\"Low elongated furry torso with four short limbs and readable elbow/knee bends; not specialized digging forearms or hopping hindlimbs.\",\"Slender tapering moderately long balancing tail, not a paddle, squirrel plume or prehensile curl.\",\"Small rounded external ears and modest eyes; soft anatomy inferred, not cartoon rodent ears.\",\"Five small clawed digits per foot as conservative reconstruction; not primate grasping hands or cloven hooves.\",\"Closed or almost closed mouth; if teeth shown, small differentiated insectivore teeth with canines, not enlarged paired rodent incisors.\"]}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Complete small long-snouted mammaliaform with slender balancing tail; adult M.oehleri skull informs a genus-level inferred living body.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Genus-level whole living reconstruction, not an articulated fossil or scan. Cranial shape uses adult M.oehleri IVPP8685; body uses Museum Wales research-informed reconstruction. Body and tail proportions, fur, external ears and colors are inferred; do not combine them into a measured single individual. Skull model length32mm is an approximate reading of the DigiMorph5mm image bar, not a published caliper measurement.\",\"zh\":\"属级完整活体复原，非完整关节连接化石或扫描。颅形参考成年M.oehleri IVPP8685；身体参考威尔士博物馆研究复原。身体尾部比例、毛、外耳与色彩均为推断，不得宣称同一标本实测。颅长32毫米为DigiMorph图5毫米尺估读，非论文卡尺实测。\"},\"original_inventory_ordinal\":664,\"taxon\":\"Morganucodon, genus-level reconstruction\",\"classification\":\"Morganucodontidae, Mammaliaformes; stem mammal, not a modern rodent\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"skull_length_model_m\":0.032,\"head_body_model_m\":0.11,\"tail_model_m\":0.06,\"status\":\"Skull approximate image-ruler estimate: about6.4 times labeled5mm. Head-body110mm and tail60mm artistic proportions using museum reconstruction, not complete fossil measurements.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Slender elongated low snout, visible transition to somewhat wider posterior skull, not globular short mouse face.\",\"Low elongated furry torso with four short limbs and readable elbow/knee bends; not specialized digging forearms or hopping hindlimbs.\",\"Slender tapering moderately long balancing tail, not a paddle, squirrel plume or prehensile curl.\",\"Small rounded external ears and modest eyes; soft anatomy inferred, not cartoon rodent ears.\",\"Five small clawed digits per foot as conservative reconstruction; not primate grasping hands or cloven hooves.\",\"Closed or almost closed mouth; if teeth shown, small differentiated insectivore teeth with canines, not enlarged paired rodent incisors.\"]}"
  },
